	~%-100%aorist (1) active optative 1st pl. of the verb “I order”#Incorrect. The aorist (1) active optative 1st pl. of the verb “I order” is **κελεύσαιμεν** (Ch. 3).
	~%-100%perfect active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I order”#Incorrect. The perfect active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I order” is **κεκελεύκαμεν** (Ch. 3).
}


